    {
      "source": "Ordered at <a href=\"../core/Ordered.html#LOWEST_PRECEDENCE\"><code>Ordered.LOWEST_PRECEDENCE</code></a> to allow other user-defined\n<a href=\"BeanInfoFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans\"><code>BeanInfoFactory</code></a> types to take precedence.",
      "translation": "在 <a href=\"../core/Ordered.html#LOWEST_PRECEDENCE\"><code>Ordered.LOWEST_PRECEDENCE</code></a> 处排序，以允许其他用户定义的<a href=\"BeanInfoFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans\"><code>BeanInfoFactory</code></a>类型具有优先权。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "To be configured via a <code>META-INF/spring.factories</code> file with the following content:\n<code>org.springframework.beans.BeanInfoFactory=org.springframework.beans.ExtendedBeanInfoFactory</code>",
      "translation": "需通过包含以下内容的 `<code>META-INF/spring.factories</code>` 文件进行配置：\n`<code>org.springframework.beans.BeanInfoFactory=org.springframework.beans.ExtendedBeanInfoFactory</code>`",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
